{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20790","headline":"感古四首 一 · 卢仝","name":"感古四首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天生圣明君，必资忠贤臣。\n舜禹竭股肱，共佐尧爲君。\n四载成地理，七政齐天文。\n阶下蓂荚生，琴上南风薰。\n轮转夏殷周，时复犹一人。\n秦汉事谗巧，魏晋忘机钧。\n猜忌相翦灭，尔来迷恩亲。\n以愚保其身，不觉身沈沦。\n以智理其国，遂爲国之贼。\n苟图容一身，万事良可恻。\n可怜万乘君，聪明受沈惑。\n忠良伏草莽，无因施羽翼。\n日月异又蚀，天地晦如墨。\n既亢而後求，异哉龙之德。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}